%N A396832 Number of permutations p of [n] such that k * p(k) >= n-1 for 1 <= k <= n.
%H A396832 Seiichi Manyama, <a href="/A396832/b396832.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..452</a>
%F A396832 a(n) = Product_{k=1..n} (n - k + 2 - ceiling((n-1)/k)) unless n = 1.
%o A396832 (PARI) a(n) = if(n==1, 1, prod(k=1, n, n-k+2-ceil((n-1)/k)));
